                "circle_ios_fallback_text": "@Patrice"
              },
              {
                "text": " great to have you here.",
                "type": "text",
                "circle_ios_fallback_text": " great to have you here."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "Your focus on balancing a clean consumer execution layer with a centralized, scalable AI intelligence foundation is exactly the kind of thinking this cohort is built for. ",
                "type": "text",
                "circle_ios_fallback_text": "Your focus on balancing a clean consumer execution layer with a centralized, scalable AI intelligence foundation is exactly the kind of thinking this cohort is built for. "
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "Looking forward to learning from your perspective and seeing how your operating model evolves throughout the cohort.",
                "type": "text",
                "circle_ios_fallback_text": "Looking forward to learning from your perspective and seeing how your operating model evolves throughout the cohort."
              }
            ]
