                },
                "circle_ios_fallback_text": "@Patrice"
              },
              {
                "text": " ! Nice to meet you. Your health-focused AI platform sounds really interesting—especially with the longevity and anti-aging boom these days. There’s so much information out there, and I find it hard to figure out what actually works for me.",
                "type": "text",
                "circle_ios_fallback_text": " ! Nice to meet you. Your health-focused AI platform sounds really interesting—especially with the longevity and anti-aging boom these days. There’s so much information out there, and I find it hard to figure out what actually works for me."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "I’d love to learn more about what you’re building !! ",
                "type": "text",
                "circle_ios_fallback_text": "I’d love to learn more about what you’re building !! "
              }
            ]
